Troubleshooting Tips
Alerts Not Firing:

Verify PromQL expressions are correct
Check evaluation interval in prometheus.yml
Ensure metrics are being scraped (check targets page)
Verify for duration has elapsed
Alertmanager Not Receiving Alerts:

Check Prometheus alerting configuration
Verify Alertmanager is running on correct port
Check Prometheus logs for connection errors
Webhook Not Receiving Alerts:

Verify webhook receiver is running
Check Alertmanager routing configuration
Review Alertmanager logs for delivery errors
Common PromQL Issues:

Use rate() for counter metrics
Use by(instance) for per-instance aggregation
Verify metric names match exactly (case-sensitive)
